{"id":"memorial_100302","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial100300","label":"Call Logs · Call Log 017515"},"label":"03:42 PM","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_100301","next":"memorial_100303","speakers":{"B":"B","A":"A"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_100302_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"Jesus, now they're sending in tanks?"},{"id":"memorial_100302_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"Tanks?"},{"id":"memorial_100302_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"More and more soldiers are gathering outside. Guess aliens really do exist."},{"id":"memorial_100302_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"Don't be ridiculous."},{"id":"memorial_100302_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"This is the first time I've seen something like this. Looks pretty serious."},{"id":"memorial_100302_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"Should we hide?"},{"id":"memorial_100302_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_03_02_description","text":"Why? You don't get to see this everyday."}]}